# Generated by `nx gen-webfonts` (packages/webfonts) from the fonts egui
# embeds. Not committed: the output is a pure function of a pinned crate, so a
# stored copy could only ever fall behind it. The licences are written out
# beside them for the same reason — they must cover the exact bytes shipped.
/public/fonts
